"""simorgh-store — SimorghOS app store.

A single, professional place to search and install anything:
  * Debian (apt) packages
  * Flathub (flatpak) apps

Search, category filters, a featured banner, and a card grid with a real
install state machine (idle → installing → installed / failed) so the user
can add any application to the system.
"""
